WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.026
Last one.

2
00:00:02.146 --> 00:00:06.178
MyWell is used in a lot of places and a lot of
languages,

3
00:00:06.298 --> 00:00:09.802
so the Settings page is worth five minutes of
your time.

4
00:00:10.617 --> 00:00:12.777
This is the Settings page.

5
00:00:12.897 --> 00:00:19.065
Everything here changes how the app behaves for you
only — none of it touches the data other people see.

6
00:00:19.883 --> 00:00:23.795
Language first, because it is the one that
matters most.

7
00:00:23.915 --> 00:00:26.891
MyWell speaks sixty-one languages.

8
00:00:27.011 --> 00:00:32.915
Choose yours here and the whole app changes
immediately — menus, buttons, help text,

9
00:00:33.035 --> 00:00:35.267
and the tutorial itself.

10
00:00:36.083 --> 00:00:39.083
Display settings control how the app looks.

11
00:00:39.203 --> 00:00:41.795
There is a light theme and a dark theme.

12
00:00:41.915 --> 00:00:45.875
Outdoors in bright sun the light theme is much
easier to read;

13
00:00:45.995 --> 00:00:50.003
the dark one is kinder at night and uses a
little less battery.

14
00:00:50.817 --> 00:00:53.409
And this is the tutorial itself.

15
00:00:53.529 --> 00:00:58.401
You can replay the whole walkthrough, or tick
just the pages you want to see again.

16
00:00:58.521 --> 00:01:03.393
It runs on practice data, so you can press
anything without worrying about it.

17
00:01:04.217 --> 00:01:06.761
Your profile page is next door.

18
00:01:06.881 --> 00:01:11.657
Your name, your contact details, and your
password all live here.

19
00:01:11.777 --> 00:01:16.721
If you ever think somebody else knows your
password, change it here, today.

20
00:01:17.550 --> 00:01:19.494
That is the whole page.

21
00:01:19.614 --> 00:01:24.270
You can replay this tutorial any time from the
Learning page inside the app.

22
00:01:24.390 --> 00:01:27.366
Thanks for helping look after our groundwater.
